e  and make them the quote pariah's that  they are  now as president he will have to balance  that with maintaining a good  relationship with saudi arabia  not only because of the oil and  resources it controls but because it is  a strategic  base in the region and an important ally  in the fight against terrorism  tony complicated situation for the bite  administration weija thank you very much
 

